# Real paraphrases -- a whole question, in the words a reader actually uses.
#
# F-014's class. None of these repeats a published surface; each names the same measurable
# in ordinary language. This is the half of retrieval a character-trigram space cannot
# reach except by accident, and the half an embedding model has to earn its place on.

[para-en-001]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How fast are prices rising?
expect: e4293295-fb43-46b0-7ac5-08dec461c23d
why: Inflation, with no form of the word "inflation" in the question.

[para-en-002]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How many people live here?
expect: 160100bc-528f-4622-bc88-08de9e09a558
why: Total Population, asked the way anyone asks it.

[para-en-003]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much of the economy does not come from oil and gas?
expect: a8296f0b-92c0-4275-bc89-08de9e09a558, f3de8791-b7fd-4135-6a2f-08dea2389ab1
why: Non-Hydrocarbon Real GDP, or the "Non-Hydrocarbon" detail of the Real GDP indicator -- the export publishes both and either is a defensible answer.

[para-en-004]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much does the country owe relative to the size of its economy?
expect: 25c35273-5ea8-477d-a79f-08def0866aac
why: Public Debt as a Percentage of GDP. The measured overlap between "relative to the economy" and "as a percentage of GDP" in the trigram space is zero.

[para-en-005]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How full are the hotels?
expect: 4f2dc17c-83dd-427a-7ab5-08dec461c23d
why: Occupancy Rate of Hotels.

[para-en-006]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How many tourists come from abroad?
expect: 7bd4d5a6-a5b9-4a63-7ab3-08dec461c23d
why: Number of International Visitors -- "tourists" for "visitors".

[para-en-007]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much do visitors spend while they are here?
expect: 003b873d-ea5d-467f-19f5-08de34c36766
why: In-Destination Spend.

[para-en-008]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How many beds do the hospitals have?
expect: 966b1cac-bff0-4d5a-7abe-08dec461c23d
why: Number of Hospital Beds.

[para-en-009]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How many doctors and nurses are practising?
expect: 309fecc8-04a0-4478-d2e6-08ded4dc1597
why: Number of Health Practitioners.

[para-en-010]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much water is used?
expect: 9cc91459-7e8e-4ec2-870b-08dee641c19a
why: Water Consumption.

[para-en-011]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much carbon does the country put into the air?
expect: 6836f2fa-f1c8-4023-7ab2-08dec461c23d
why: Greenhouse Gas Emissions, with no shared word at all.

[para-en-012]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: What share of electricity comes from the sun?
expect: 0bc36c83-76c2-4a59-eb86-08ddb722adc5
why: Percentage of energy generated by solar.

[para-en-013]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How long does it take to get a shipment out of the country?
expect: d4a431d6-febe-4bd1-eb4b-08ddb722adc5
why: Export Time.

[para-en-014]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: What does it cost to bring goods in?
expect: 84bec68c-5603-4855-8592-08ddb7179f3f
why: Import Cost.

[para-en-015]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: Is the state spending more than it takes in?
expect: 2d5b179d-6b42-45b6-f4e8-08decfcf581a, 3c061c1e-f1ae-49a8-f4eb-08decfcf581a
why: The budget surplus/deficit detail, published twice under two indicators.

[para-en-016]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much money does the government take in that is not from oil and gas?
expect: 68631efe-4a3e-4dae-c6b5-08deeafdc6dc, 990d2e5e-83a2-4d42-f4e6-08decfcf581a
why: Non-hydrocarbon government revenue, published under two indicators.

[para-en-017]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much is set aside for schools in the budget?
expect: 44a7f5b5-ce35-41ff-7a7f-08dec461c23d
why: Budget Allocation by Sector -- Education.

[para-en-018]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much food does the country grow for itself?
expect: 1cd26573-709e-4391-7aa2-08dec461c23d, 137dd4c7-beb0-426b-7aa3-08dec461c23d, 3f9092c8-2284-4a5b-7aa4-08dec461c23d, 1acfd15f-410f-49cf-7aa5-08dec461c23d, 0be4eed1-0c84-43bb-7aa6-08dec461c23d, 0ae87036-f178-4e92-7aa7-08dec461c23d
why: Self-Sufficiency for Strategic Commodities; the indicator is split by commodity and the question names none, so any of its food details is a defensible first hit.

[para-en-019]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How many students does each teacher have in state schools?
expect: beee30c1-b0ee-4b24-92c6-08dec462e127
why: Number of Students per Teacher in Public Schools.

[para-en-020]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: What does the state spend on each pupil?
expect: 47c56938-ded8-4e8e-7a4c-08dec461c23d
why: Cost per Student (K-12 Public Schools).

[para-en-021]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How many graduates come out of science and engineering degrees?
expect: 0a59b732-7d4c-497a-eb67-08ddb722adc5
why: Graduates from STEM (Share of All Graduates).

[para-en-022]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much are workers producing each year compared with last?
expect: dbd76ae3-518d-414e-eb54-08ddb722adc5
why: Annual Growth in Labor Productivity.

[para-en-023]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much lending are small businesses getting?
expect: ad05134a-30f9-4dae-eb8c-08ddb722adc5, d6136c19-701a-4e98-c16e-08de737b95b6
why: Credit Provided to SMEs, and the private banks' share of it.

[para-en-024]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: What do the ratings agencies say about the country's creditworthiness?
expect: e6c456df-8b8e-4619-7ab9-08dec461c23d, 28b24086-78be-4402-7aba-08dec461c23d, e33f945b-82a3-4eab-7abb-08dec461c23d
why: The three published credit-rating details -- Fitch, S&P and Moody's.

[para-en-025]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much wheat is kept in reserve?
expect: 7c94c8d5-ead1-443a-9658-08de66e6ef19
why: Minimum Reserves of Strategic Commodities -- Wheat.

[para-en-026]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How expensive is it to put food on the table?
expect: f29bc176-82b1-46b0-a4d1-08deb9658cc1
why: Cost of Living -- Food and Beverages.

[para-en-027]
lang: en
kind: paraphrase
question: How much gas is shipped to China?
expect: c206b104-5756-42ba-a4c7-08deb9658cc1
why: Qatar LNG Export -- China.

[para-ar-001]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: كم ارتفعت الأسعار؟
expect: e4293295-fb43-46b0-7ac5-08dec461c23d
why: Inflation, in Arabic, without the published word التضخم.

[para-ar-002]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: كم عدد سكان الدولة؟
expect: 160100bc-528f-4622-bc88-08de9e09a558
why: Total Population, asked naturally rather than copied.

[para-ar-003]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: ما حجم الاقتصاد بعيداً عن النفط والغاز؟
expect: a8296f0b-92c0-4275-bc89-08de9e09a558, f3de8791-b7fd-4135-6a2f-08dea2389ab1
why: Non-hydrocarbon real GDP. The published surfaces say الهيدروكربوني, which shares no root with النفط والغاز -- the Arabic half of the synonym problem.

[para-ar-004]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: كم نسبة الديون مقارنة بحجم الاقتصاد؟
expect: 25c35273-5ea8-477d-a79f-08def0866aac
why: Public debt as a share of GDP, paraphrased.

[para-ar-005]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: كم عدد الزوار القادمين من الخارج؟
expect: 7bd4d5a6-a5b9-4a63-7ab3-08dec461c23d
why: Number of International Visitors.

[para-ar-006]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: ما مقدار إنفاق السائح أثناء زيارته؟
expect: 003b873d-ea5d-467f-19f5-08de34c36766
why: In-Destination Spend; the published Arabic name is the two words إنفاق السائح.

[para-ar-007]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: كم عدد الأطباء والممرضين العاملين؟
expect: 309fecc8-04a0-4478-d2e6-08ded4dc1597
why: Number of Health Practitioners.

[para-ar-008]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: ما كمية المياه المستهلكة؟
expect: 9cc91459-7e8e-4ec2-870b-08dee641c19a
why: Water Consumption, with the noun turned into a participle -- finding 42's morphology.

[para-ar-009]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: ما نسبة الكهرباء المولدة من الشمس؟
expect: 0bc36c83-76c2-4a59-eb86-08ddb722adc5
why: Percentage of energy generated by solar.

[para-ar-010]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: كم يستغرق إخراج شحنة من البلاد؟
expect: d4a431d6-febe-4bd1-eb4b-08ddb722adc5
why: Export Time.

[para-ar-011]
lang: ar
kind: paraphrase
question: هل تنفق الدولة أكثر مما تجني؟
expect: 2d5b179d-6b42-45b6-f4e8-08decfcf581a, 3c061c1e-f1ae-49a8-f4eb-08decfcf581a
